{
  "name": "Avisar sismo por WhatsApp",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "sismo-alerta",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1a0b1e0-1111-4a1a-8c1a-000000000001",
      "name": "Sismo publicado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "notes": "El listener de EMSC/USGS llama esta URL en cuanto un catálogo publica un sismo que cumple el filtro."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "alert-token",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.headers['x-alert-token'] }}",
              "rightValue": "CAMBIA-ESTE-TOKEN",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1a0b1e0-1111-4a1a-8c1a-000000000002",
      "name": "Token correcto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [280, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://evolution.capitalimpulso.com/message/sendText/mendozalz2",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { number: $json.body.number, text: $json.body.text } }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "c1a0b1e0-1111-4a1a-8c1a-000000000003",
      "name": "Avisar por WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [560, -80],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "notes": "Misma credencial Header Auth EvolutionApi del aviso de correo. El número es el celular que sí recibió la prueba."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { ok: true } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "c1a0b1e0-1111-4a1a-8c1a-000000000004",
      "name": "Aceptar aviso",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [840, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { error: \"whatsapp_failed\" } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 502
        }
      },
      "id": "c1a0b1e0-1111-4a1a-8c1a-000000000005",
      "name": "Fallo de WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [840, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { error: \"unauthorized\" } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 401
        }
      },
      "id": "c1a0b1e0-1111-4a1a-8c1a-000000000006",
      "name": "Rechazar token",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [560, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Aviso de sismo\nEMSC o USGS publican el sismo y el listener llama este webhook una vez por cada número en WHATSAPP_NUMBERS. Solo entran sismos de magnitud 4.5 o más, dentro de 300 km de Medellín o en Colombia.\n\nNo adelanta la onda.\n\nAntes de activarlo:\n1. Inventa una clave y ponla igual en este nodo (CAMBIA-ESTE-TOKEN) y en ALERT_TOKEN del listener. No sale de Google ni de Evolution.\n2. En Avisar por WhatsApp elige la credencial Header Auth EvolutionApi.\n3. Activa el workflow.\n4. Despliega la carpeta sismos en Dokploy.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c1a0b1e0-1111-4a1a-8c1a-000000000007",
      "name": "Nota de configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 260]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Sismo publicado": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Token correcto",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Token correcto": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Avisar por WhatsApp",
